{"game":"heroes98-map","v":1,"name":"Девятый вал","about":"Пятая миссия кампании «Чаша».","w":112,"h":112,"levels":1,"players":[{"who":"human","factions":["tide"],"team":0,"town":1},{"who":"ai","factions":["league"],"team":1,"town":2}],"goals":{"win":[{"kind":"flag","flag":"n_never","text":"Выполнить задания миссии"}],"lose":[{"kind":"all"},{"kind":"hero","hid":"naera"},{"kind":"town","town":1}]},"forbid":[],"heart":null,"next":46,"ter":[""],"road":["AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8AMQ=="],"river":["AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8AMQ=="],"over":["AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8A/wD/AP8AMQ=="],"objs":[{"id":1,"l":0,"t":"town","c":9,"r":53,"owner":0,"faction":"tide","name":"Раковинная Лагуна","tag":"home","built":["hall1","hall2","hall3","fort1","fort2","tavern","market","smith","store","dwell1","dwell2","dwell3","dwell4","dwell5","dwell6","guild1","guild2","special1","special2"],"forbid":["altar"]},{"id":2,"l":0,"t":"town","c":98,"r":50,"owner":1,"faction":"league","name":"Белая гавань","tag":"harbor","built":["hall1","hall2","fort1","fort2"],"forbid":["tavern","dwell1","dwell1u","dwell2","dwell2u","dwell3","dwell3u","dwell4","dwell4u","dwell5","dwell5u","dwell6","dwell6u","dwell7","dwell7u","altar","shipyard","hall3","hall4","guild1","market","caravan"],"garrison":[{"unit":"crossbow","count":20},{"unit":"plated","count":4},{"unit":"mercenaries","count":20}]},{"id":3,"l":0,"t":"sawmill","c":18,"r":66,"owner":-1},{"id":4,"l":0,"t":"goldmine","c":12,"r":62,"owner":-1},{"id":5,"l":0,"t":"saltworks","c":33,"r":22,"owner":-1},{"id":6,"l":0,"t":"monster","c":35,"r":24,"owner":-1,"unit":"pirates","count":30,"max":90,"mood":"hostile"},{"id":7,"l":0,"t":"ambermine","c":33,"r":86,"owner":-1},{"id":8,"l":0,"t":"monster","c":35,"r":88,"owner":-1,"unit":"pirates","count":30,"max":90,"mood":"hostile"},{"id":9,"l":0,"t":"goldmine","c":59,"r":60,"owner":-1},{"id":10,"l":0,"t":"monster","c":61,"r":62,"owner":-1,"unit":"seaserpent","count":4,"max":12,"mood":"hostile"},{"id":11,"l":0,"t":"dwell-turtlefort","c":83,"r":19,"owner":-1,"pool":2},{"id":12,"l":0,"t":"monster","c":85,"r":21,"owner":-1,"unit":"seaserpent","count":5,"max":15,"mood":"hostile"},{"id":13,"l":0,"t":"dwell-rayrider","c":83,"r":91,"owner":-1},{"id":14,"l":0,"t":"monster","c":85,"r":93,"owner":-1,"unit":"seaserpent","count":5,"max":15,"mood":"hostile"},{"id":15,"l":0,"t":"sunkentemple","c":57,"r":11,"owner":-1},{"id":16,"l":0,"t":"luckspring","c":57,"r":100,"owner":-1},{"id":17,"l":0,"t":"monster","c":59,"r":101,"owner":-1,"unit":"azurespirit","count":14,"max":42,"mood":"hostile"},{"id":18,"l":0,"t":"res-gold","c":24,"r":46,"owner":-1},{"id":19,"l":0,"t":"res-gold","c":30,"r":60,"owner":-1},{"id":20,"l":0,"t":"res-gold","c":56,"r":54,"owner":-1},{"id":21,"l":0,"t":"res-gold","c":64,"r":58,"owner":-1},{"id":22,"l":0,"t":"res-gold","c":36,"r":22,"owner":-1},{"id":23,"l":0,"t":"res-gold","c":36,"r":90,"owner":-1},{"id":24,"l":0,"t":"res-gold","c":82,"r":22,"owner":-1},{"id":25,"l":0,"t":"res-gold","c":82,"r":94,"owner":-1},{"id":26,"l":0,"t":"res-salt","c":26,"r":64,"owner":-1},{"id":27,"l":0,"t":"res-salt","c":62,"r":54,"owner":-1},{"id":28,"l":0,"t":"res-salt","c":100,"r":66,"owner":-1},{"id":29,"l":0,"t":"res-amber","c":12,"r":48,"owner":-1},{"id":30,"l":0,"t":"res-amber","c":58,"r":64,"owner":-1},{"id":31,"l":0,"t":"res-wood","c":14,"r":68,"owner":-1},{"id":32,"l":0,"t":"res-wood","c":26,"r":50,"owner":-1},{"id":33,"l":0,"t":"barrel","c":32,"r":46,"owner":-1},{"id":34,"l":0,"t":"barrel","c":68,"r":61,"owner":-1},{"id":35,"l":0,"t":"barrel","c":84,"r":50,"owner":-1},{"id":36,"l":0,"t":"watchtower","c":62,"r":49,"owner":-1},{"id":37,"l":0,"t":"campfire","c":22,"r":44,"owner":-1},{"id":38,"l":0,"t":"signstone","c":28,"r":56,"owner":-1,"text":"Чаша дышит. Кто ждёт отлива, тот ходит посуху. Кто не ждёт, тот плавает."},{"id":39,"l":0,"t":"signstone","c":88,"r":60,"owner":-1,"text":"Белая гавань. Флагман регента. Не подходить ближе выстрела."},{"id":40,"l":0,"t":"rock","c":39,"r":23,"owner":-1},{"id":41,"l":0,"t":"rock","c":39,"r":86,"owner":-1},{"id":42,"l":0,"t":"rock","c":76,"r":40,"owner":-1},{"id":43,"l":0,"t":"rock","c":76,"r":72,"owner":-1},{"id":44,"l":0,"t":"rock","c":6,"r":6,"owner":-1},{"id":45,"l":0,"t":"rock","c":104,"r":104,"owner":-1}],"heroes":[{"owner":0,"hid":"naera","c":11,"r":55,"l":0,"tag":"naera","army":[{"unit":"shellman","count":80},{"unit":"claw","count":30},{"unit":"harpooner","count":30},{"unit":"jelly","count":20},{"unit":"seawitch","count":12},{"unit":"rayrider","count":6},{"unit":"turtlefort","count":2}]},{"owner":1,"hid":"merra","c":87,"r":21,"l":0,"tag":"merra","xp":20000,"patrol":1,"army":[{"unit":"seawitch","count":10},{"unit":"stinger","count":8},{"unit":"stormray","count":2},{"unit":"turtlefort","count":1}]}],"events":[],"scenes":"event day 1 -> c5_start\nevent day 3 -> c5_ebb\nevent day 6 -> c5_flood\nevent day 9 -> c5_ebb\nevent day 12 -> c5_flood\nevent day 15 -> c5_ebb\nevent day 18 -> c5_flood\nevent day 21 -> c5_ebb\nevent day 24 -> c5_flood\nevent day 27 -> c5_ebb\nevent day 4 -> c5_leave1\nevent day 7 -> c5_leave2\nevent day 8 -> c5_wave1\nevent day 16 -> c5_wave2\nevent defeat merra -> c5_caught\n\n@c5_start\nshow naera left\nshow oola right\noola: Мерра ушла к Белой гавани. Там флагман регента. Через четыре недели он поднимет паруса.\nnaera: Тогда у меня четыре недели.\noola: Она идёт не прямо. Ждёт на островах, пока за ней не придут, и уходит дальше.\noola: Чаша сейчас дышит неровно. Каждые три дня вода уходит и возвращается. На отливе поднимаются мели и рифы.\nnaera: А на мелях пройдут их солдаты.\noola: И твои тоже. Смотри на воду.\ngoal add merra \"Догнать Мерру\" to merra\ngoal lose day 28\nif not diff easy\narmy merra seawitch 6 stinger 6 stormray 2\narmy harbor crossbow 10 plated 2\nend\nif diff hard\narmy merra seawitch 4 stinger 6 turtlefort 1\nend\nif diff impossible\narmy merra seawitch 10 stinger 12 stormray 3 turtlefort 2\narmy harbor crossbow 20 plated 6\nend\nif kept shell_found\nshow naera left\nnaera: У меня есть раковина. Если сердце ещё на дне, она его услышит.\nend\nif kept dredges_fast\nshow luar right\nluar: Мы разбили черпальни быстро, белые не успели поднять всех людей. У них в гавани половина гарнизона.\nend\naim player 1 home\nend\n\n@c5_ebb\nterrain sand 35 55 15 3\nterrain sand 70 54 14 5\nterrain rock 70 30 2 18\nterrain rock 70 65 2 18\nif not flag ebb1\nset ebb1\nshow naera left\nnaera: Отлив. Вода ушла с мелей, поднялись рифы.\nsay На отливе мели становятся сушей, а рифы перекрывают проливы. Через три дня вода вернётся.\nend\nend\n\n@c5_flood\nterrain water 35 55 15 3\nterrain water 70 54 14 5\nterrain water 70 30 2 18\nterrain water 70 65 2 18\nend\n\n@c5_leave1\nif not beaten merra\nmove merra 87 93\nshow luar right\nluar: Мерра ушла с северного острова ночью. Её парус видели на юге.\nend\nend\n\n@c5_leave2\nif not beaten merra\nmove merra 100 52\nshow luar right\nluar: Мерра в Белой гавани. Теперь её придётся брать вместе со стенами.\nend\nend\n\n@c5_wave1\nspawn hero ortwin 1 92 60 0 wave1\narmy wave1 crossbow 30 mercenaries 40 plated 8 bountyhunters 8\nif not diff easy\narmy wave1 crossbow 20 plated 4\nend\nif diff impossible\narmy wave1 crossbow 30 plated 8 bountyhunters 12\nend\nshow luar right\nluar: С Белой гавани сошли солдаты. Ждут отлива, чтобы пройти по мелям.\nend\n\n@c5_wave2\nspawn hero yosta 1 92 64 0 wave2\narmy wave2 crossbow 40 mercenaries 50 plated 10 bountyhunters 12\nif not diff easy\narmy wave2 crossbow 20 plated 6\nend\nif diff impossible\narmy wave2 crossbow 40 plated 10 bountyhunters 16\nend\nshow yosta right\nyosta: Опять вы. Мне платят за каждый ваш остров, жрица. Не обижайтесь.\nend\n\n@c5_caught\nshow naera left\nshow merra right\nmerra: Опоздала. Сердце уже на флагмане. Регент ушёл на рассвете.\nnaera: Зачем, Мерра?\nmerra: Вы тысячу лет поёте одну песню и не знаете, чем она кончается. Я хотела услышать конец.\nnaera: У неё нет конца. Её поют, пока нужно.\nmerra: Вот и пой. А я посмотрю, кто из нас был прав.\nnaera: Уходи. Ты моя сестра, и луна это слышит.\ngoal done merra\nkeep merra_spared\nkeep heart_given\nwin\nend\n"}